#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:1
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide will walk you through installing NPUSlim and performing your "
"first model quantization."
msgstr "本指南将带你完成 NPUSlim 的安装，并进行第一次模型量化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:7
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:9
msgid "Python >= 3.11"
msgstr "Python >= 3.11"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:10
msgid "CANN toolkit installed"
msgstr "已安装 CANN 工具包"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:11
msgid "`ASCEND_HOME_PATH` environment variable set"
msgstr "已设置 `ASCEND_HOME_PATH` 环境变量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:18
msgid "Install NPUSlim"
msgstr "安装 NPUSlim"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:25
msgid ""
"The `-e` flag installs in development mode, and `-v` enables verbose "
"output."
msgstr "`-e` 参数以开发模式安装，`-v` 参数启用详细输出。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:27
msgid "Your First Quantization"
msgstr "你的第一次量化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:29
msgid "1. Prepare Config"
msgstr "1. 准备配置文件"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:31
msgid ""
"Edit a config file in `configs/compressor/`, for example "
"`int8_dyn/qwen3_0_6b.yaml`:"
msgstr ""
"编辑 `configs/compressor/` 目录下的配置文件，例如 `int8_dyn/qwen3_0_6b.yaml`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:66
msgid "2. Run Quantization"
msgstr "2. 运行量化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:72
msgid "3. Check Output"
msgstr "3. 检查输出"

#: ../../source/tutorials/getting_started.md:74
msgid ""
"After completion, the quantized model will be saved to "
"`./outputs/<model_name>/`."
msgstr "完成后，量化模型将保存到 `./outputs/<model_name>/` 目录。"

